      <p class="article-intro">Small businesses no longer need expensive enterprise software or dedicated night-shift teams to provide 24/7 customer support. WhatsApp has launched <strong>Meta Business Agents</strong>, allowing brands to deploy intelligent, conversational AI reps directly inside chat.</p>
    </div>
